        "source_sentence": "DA-polyesters were synthesised from diacid chlorides, i.e., succinyl chloride, terephthaloyl chloride, isophthaloyl chloride, and phthaloyl chloride (95%, Acros), and diacetylene diols, i.e., HDD, ODD-2, ODD-2M."
